<div class="min-h-screen bg-base-100">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-16 px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-base-content/50 mb-12">Last updated: March 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">The Short Version</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          We collect what we need to run the service and nothing more. We don't sell
          your data. Your audio files are yours, and we delete them after processing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">1. Data Controller</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          Munchy Cow is operated by Yann Jubelin, with NIF: Y5606049C, located at
          carrer de les calandries 19, Barcelona, Spain.
          Contact: privacy@munchycow.com.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Account Information</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              When you create an account, we collect your email address. We use
              magic links for authentication, so no password is stored.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Audio Files</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              You upload audio files for processing. We store these temporarily while
              processing and for a limited time afterward so you can download the results.
              Files are automatically and permanently deleted 7 days after processing.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Payment Information</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              Payment processing is handled entirely by our Merchant of Record, Polar Sh, Inc.
              We do not store your credit card details; we only receive a reference to the
              transaction for accounting.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Usage Data</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              We collect basic analytics about how you use the service: pages visited,
              features used, processing jobs created. This helps us improve the service.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-base-content/80 space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>To provide and improve the Service</li>
          <li>To communicate with you about your account</li>
          <li>To process payments</li>
          <li>To detect and prevent abuse</li>
          <li>To comply with legal obligations (e.g. tax reporting to the Spanish Tax Agency)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">4. Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Under GDPR, we process your data based on:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-base-content/80 space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li><strong>Contract:</strong> To provide the audio processing service you signed up for</li>
          <li><strong>Legitimate Interest:</strong> To improve our service and prevent abuse</li>
          <li><strong>Legal Obligation:</strong> To comply with tax and accounting requirements</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">5. Sub-processors</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          To provide the Service, we share limited data with the following providers:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-none text-base-content/80 space-y-3 ml-4">
          <li><strong>Infrastructure:</strong> Hetzner Online GmbH (Germany). Our primary processing servers are located in the European Union.</li>
          <li><strong>Storage:</strong> Cloudflare, Inc. (R2) (USA/Global). Used for encrypted storage of your audio files.</li>
          <li><strong>Payments & Taxes:</strong> Polar Sh, Inc. (USA). Our Merchant of Record for global billing and tax compliance.</li>
          <li><strong>Email Delivery:</strong> Resend, Inc. (USA). Used for sending magic links and transactional notifications.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">6. International Data Transfers</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          While we prioritize EU processing, we use US-based providers (Cloudflare, Polar, Resend).
          These transfers are protected by Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) and/or the EU-U.S.
          Data Privacy Framework to ensure your data receives a level of protection equivalent to
          that of the GDPR.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">7. Data Retention</h2>
        <ul class="list-none text-base-content/80 space-y-3 ml-4">
          <li><strong>Audio Files:</strong> Automatically and permanently deleted from storage 7 days after processing.</li>
          <li><strong>Account Data:</strong> Retained until you delete your account.</li>
          <li><strong>Billing/Tax Data:</strong> We are legally required to keep records of sales and tax data for 6 years to comply with the Spanish Commercial Code (Código de Comercio).</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">8. Data Security</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          We use industry-standard security measures to protect your data, including
          encryption in transit and at rest. Audio files are stored in encrypted
          cloud storage with access controls.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">9. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          You have the right to access, rectify, or delete your data, and to object to or
          restrict its processing. You can exercise these rights through your account settings
          or by emailing privacy@munchycow.com.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the
          Agencia Española de Protección de Datos (AEPD).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">10. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          We use essential cookies to keep you logged in and remember your preferences.
          We do not use tracking cookies for advertising or third-party marketing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">11. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          The Service is not intended for children under 13. We don't knowingly
          collect data from children.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          We may update this policy from time to time. We'll notify you of significant
          changes via email.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">13. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          Questions about privacy? Contact us at privacy@munchycow.com.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-base-300">
      <.link href={locale_path(@locale, "/")} class="btn btn-ghost">
        &larr; Back to home
      </.link>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
